持久化每个应用版本和系统版本的候选结果，通过稳定窗口固定已验证后端，并在候选耗尽后熔断。helper/service 进程崩溃只切换自身后端，不再关闭前台任务。
---
 .../server/am/FloralNativeBridgeManager.java  | 87 +++++++++++++++----
 1 file changed, 70 insertions(+), 17 deletions(-)

diff --git a/services/core/java/com/android/server/am/FloralNativeBridgeManager.java b/services/core/java/com/android/server/am/FloralNativeBridgeManager.java
index 7918b92..4204d91 100644
